ENDRA SDL RESTART - RUN 002

Fresh SDL browser, not NX Run006.
For TI-Nspire CX II CAS with Ndless.

INSTALL:
Place EndraSDL_Run002.tns in Documents.
Start it with Ndless installed.

KEYS:
UP/DOWN   choose a file or folder
ENTER     open a folder (NOT a file)
RIGHT     open a folder
LEFT      go to parent folder
ESC       parent; exits at Documents
MENU      show the help screen

Run002 cannot preview CFG or TXT files.
NO FILE WRITES, ZIP OR APP LAUNCH.
System root is never displayed.

TEST SAFETY:
Disconnect USB. Back up important work.
First test screen display and ESC exit.
Stop on any complete calculator freeze.
Do not hard-reset repeatedly.

Next features come only after stable tests.
